<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia sees 1997 rice output at 52 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indonesia sees 1997 rice output at 52 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia Agriculture Minister Syarifuddin Baharsyah said on Monday the country's unhusked rice production was projected to rise to 52 million tonnes in 1997 from an estimated 50.8 million tonnes in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We will produce around 52 million tonnes of rice in 1997. We still maintain the target for unhusked rice production in 1996 at 50.8 million,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>He gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364+</p>
